    <string name="set_shared_index_desc">Lets your other devices — and anyone else reading this folder — skip scanning and re-fetching cover art, and shares the titles, authors and series you correct so nobody has to fix them twice. Library details only: never your listening position, bookmarks or hidden books.</string>
